        "official_en_sha256": "b055aac2d113f93245400c5668bcbf8ba1ac7dbe96bc43291dbf046f2cf1ac6f"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "いい？\r\nおとぎ話ってのは、大人の作り話なの。\r\n世の中そういうもんなのよ。",
        "official_en": "Yeah, really. Look, adults make up a lot of stories. That’s just what they do.",
        "real_en": "Listen. Fairy tales are stories adults make up. That's just how the world works."
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "CHANGE"
