        "official_en_sha256": "b19a200ab8fd752d8249fe12d126ada86241b3f2eee06c96c3a77d0352d23b50"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "お店に来たのはいいんだけどね……。\r\nお外が寒くって\r\n帰るのにも勇気がいるんだよね……。",
        "official_en": "Getting here wasn’t too hard, but... I don’t wanna go back out in the cold again...",
