        "official_en_sha256": "3fd6f090fdb46689fbcbacba9b46066d05fd66f98b9f33f28675fefa1d9a1b4c"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "お礼にかまくらの中のお宝を\r\n持っていっていいよ！",
        "official_en": "Feel free to take the stuff in that igloo there. Just my way of saying thanks!",
        "real_en": "As thanks, you can take the treasure inside that igloo!"
      },
      "review": {
