        "official_en_sha256": "3942308410689d21faa40be2ec63218fc841d36e11036c4b58ca453df8a203a6"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "このあたりの山では貴重な薬草や\r\n鉱石が採れるものですから。",
        "official_en": "As luck would have it, the mountains around us are blessed with rare herbs and minerals.",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
